PART 2 — UNAPPLIED 18a DIFF

The proposed implementation uses the existing authorized Telegram callback
path because it already authenticates `effective_chat.id` before dispatching
callbacks. The new action is `clear_reconciliation_pause`; it is separate from
the existing start/stop auto-trading action and can only clear the exact
`broker_reconciliation_unavailable` reason.

