Manual-mode behavior: `session_failure_ceiling` is parsed and persisted only as
forward-compatible configuration. It has no behavioral effect in this round.
There is no auto-clear, session accounting, notification, acknowledgement
ceiling, or `auto_with_ceiling` implementation here; those remain 18b and are
out of scope.
